            "question": "Do you offer Cash on Delivery?",
            "answer": "<p>No. We accept online payments only (UPI, cards and netbanking).</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does made to order mean?",
            "answer": "<p>Many of our pieces are stitched in your size once you order, which is why delivery can take a little longer than ready stock. Small differences from piece to piece are part of being handmade.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I buy the kurti as a set?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. On kurtis with a set, choose Kurti only, + Pant, + Dupatta or the Full set. The pant is cut in the same size as your kurti.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I cancel my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders can't be cancelled once placed, because we start working on them right away. Please check your size and address before checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
